<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Om Boutique</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Young+Serif&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#eceaf4;--surface:#fff;--ink:#1c2150;--muted:#555a85;--accent:#d93f5c;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#c9c6de;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#131738;--surface:#1c2150;--ink:#eceaf4;--muted:#aeb1d6;--accent:#ff7a93;--accent-ink:#131738;--line:#363b78;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#131738;--surface:#1c2150;--ink:#eceaf4;--muted:#aeb1d6;--accent:#ff7a93;--accent-ink:#131738;--line:#363b78;color-scheme:dark}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 1.05rem/1.6 Figtree,system-ui,sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;margin:0}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.25rem}
header .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{font-family:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.3rem;text-decoration:none}
nav{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
nav a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--accent)}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:center;padding-top:3rem;padding-bottom:4rem}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5.2rem);letter-spacing:-.01em}
.hero p{max-width:34rem;color:var(--muted);margin:1.25rem 0 1.75rem}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);padding:.85rem 1.6rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink);margin-left:.5rem}
.tagwrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;transform-origin:50% 0;animation:sway 2.4s ease-out 1}
.tag{position:relative;width:min(260px,70%);background:var(--surface);border-radius:14px 14px 26px 26px;padding:3.5rem 1.5rem 2rem;text-align:center;border:2px solid var(--ink)}
.tag::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:1.2rem;left:50%;width:18px;height:18px;margin-left:-9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--ink)}
.tag::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:-70px;left:50%;width:2px;height:80px;background:var(--ink)}
.tag b{display:block;font-family:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:400}
.tag span{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.4rem}
.tag em{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
@keyframes sway{0%{transform:rotate(-7deg)}25%{transform:rotate(5deg)}50%{transform:rotate(-3deg)}75%{transform:rotate(1.5deg)}100%{transform:rotate(0)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.tagwrap{animation:none}}
section{padding:3.5rem 0}
.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.head h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.25rem}
.card{text-decoration:none}
.sw{aspect-ratio:3/4;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.s1{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#2a3175 0 10px,#343c8a 10px 20px)}
.s2{background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#f2b8c4 0 14%,transparent 15%),radial-gradient(circle at 70% 65%,#f2b8c4 0 14%,transparent 15%),#e0607a;background-size:60px 60px}
.s3{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d8c9a6 0 50%,#cdbd96 50%);background-size:24px 100%}
.s4{background:linear-gradient(#0000 0 48%,#ffffff40 48% 52%,#0000 52%),linear-gradient(90deg,#0000 0 48%,#ffffff40 48% 52%,#0000 52%),#4a7c6f;background-size:36px 36px}
.card h3{font-size:1.1rem}
.card p{margin:.15rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem}
.col{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:1.75rem}
.col h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.6rem}
.col p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:start}
.story h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem)}
.story p{margin:0 0 1rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:34rem}
.visit{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border-radius:24px;padding:2.5rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem}
.visit h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.4rem)}
.visit dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.4rem 1.25rem}
.visit dt{opacity:.75}
.visit dd{margin:0}
footer{padding:2.5rem 0 3rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:.95rem}
@media (max-width:860px){.hero,.story,.visit{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding-top:5rem}}
body{overflow-x:hidden}
.hero{position:relative}
.hero>div{position:relative;z-index:1}
.mandala{position:absolute;right:-140px;top:50%;width:560px;height:560px;margin-top:-280px;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.25}
.mandala::before,.mandala::after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%}
.mandala::before{inset:0;background:repeating-conic-gradient(var(--accent) 0 6deg,transparent 6deg 12deg);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 45%,#000 46%);mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 45%,#000 46%);animation:spin 40s linear infinite}
.mandala::after{inset:18%;background:repeating-conic-gradient(var(--ink) 0 4deg,transparent 4deg 12deg);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 25%,#000 26%);mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 25%,#000 26%);animation:spin 22s linear infinite reverse}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.fl{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.55;animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)}33%{transform:translate(24px,-34px) scale(1.2)}66%{transform:translate(-20px,-12px) scale(.85)}}
.w{display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap}
.ch{display:inline-block;animation:pop .9s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1) backwards;transition:transform .2s,color .2s}
.ch:hover{transform:translateY(-10px) rotate(-8deg);color:var(--accent)}
@keyframes pop{0%{transform:translateY(90px) rotate(25deg) scale(.2);opacity:0}100%{transform:none;opacity:1}}
.tagwrap:hover{animation:sway 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
.marquee{overflow:hidden;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);transform:rotate(-2deg);margin:1rem -2rem;padding:.9rem 0;font:400 1.4rem "Young Serif",Georgia,serif}
.track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:scroll 22s linear infinite}
.track span{white-space:nowrap;padding-right:1.5rem}
@keyframes scroll{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px) rotate(-5deg) scale(.92);transition:opacity .7s,transform .8s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1)}
.js .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.card:hover .sw{transform:rotate(-3deg) scale(1.05)}
.sw{transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1)}
.conf{position:fixed;width:10px;height:14px;border-radius:2px;pointer-events:none;z-index:50}
@media (max-width:860px){.mandala{right:-300px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mandala::before,.mandala::after,.fl,.track,.tagwrap:hover{animation:none}.ch{animation:none}}
header{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:30;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 82%,transparent);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .3s}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:var(--bg);z-index:29}
header .wrap{position:relative;transition:padding .3s}
header.sc{border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
header.sc .wrap{padding-top:.55rem;padding-bottom:.55rem}
section{scroll-margin-top:70px}
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--accent);transform-origin:0 50%;transform:scaleX(0);z-index:40}
.logo{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem}
.om{display:inline-block;color:var(--accent);transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1)}
.logo:hover .om,.logo:focus-visible .om{transform:rotate(360deg) scale(1.25)}
nav{position:relative;gap:.2rem;padding:.3rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface)}
nav a{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:.45rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;transition:color .25s}
.ind{position:absolute;top:.3rem;bottom:.3rem;left:0;width:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);z-index:0;opacity:0;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1),width .5s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1),opacity .25s}
.menu{display:none;width:46px;height:46px;padding:0;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:var(--surface);flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;cursor:pointer}
.menu span{display:block;width:20px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1),opacity .2s}
.menu[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg)}
.menu[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.menu[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg)}
@media (min-width:701px){nav a.under,nav a.under:hover,nav a.under:focus-visible{color:var(--accent-ink)}}
@media (max-width:700px){
header .wrap{flex-wrap:nowrap}
.menu{display:flex}
nav{position:absolute;top:calc(100% - .2rem);right:1.25rem;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;border-radius:22px;padding:.6rem;min-width:200px;transform:scale(.3);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform-origin:100% 0;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1),opacity .2s;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #0003}
nav.open{transform:none;opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
nav a{padding:.8rem 1rem}
nav a.on{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.ind{display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ind,nav,.om,.menu span,header .wrap{transition:none}}
.mpage{padding:3rem 0 4rem;animation:rise .6s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1)}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px) rotate(-2deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.mpage h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem)}
.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:36rem;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
.mgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start}
.field{margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.field label{display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.35rem}
.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:.8rem 1rem;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;transition:border-color .2s,transform .25s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1),box-shadow .25s}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 20px color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 30%,transparent)}
.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 1rem}
.measures{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0 1rem}
.actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.5rem}
button.btn{border:0;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
button.btn.alt{border:2px solid var(--ink)}
#m-status{min-height:1.6rem;margin:1rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
.tips{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:1.75rem}
.tips h3{font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.tips ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem;color:var(--muted)}
.tips li{margin-bottom:.6rem}
@media (max-width:860px){.mgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mpage{animation:none}.field input,.field select,.field textarea{transition:none}}
.sw{position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center}
.sw::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(110deg,transparent 30%,#ffffff55 50%,transparent 70%);background-size:250% 100%;animation:shine 2.8s linear infinite}
@keyframes shine{from{background-position:150% 0}to{background-position:-50% 0}}
.soon{position:relative;z-index:1;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);padding:.45rem 1.1rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;transform:rotate(-8deg);animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:rotate(-8deg) scale(1.12)}}
.grid .card:nth-child(2) .soon{animation-delay:.3s}
.grid .card:nth-child(3) .soon{animation-delay:.6s}
.grid .card:nth-child(4) .soon{animation-delay:.9s}
.pill{display:inline-block;margin:0 0 .6rem;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);padding:.2rem .8rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sw::after,.soon{animation:none}}
.lpage{padding:2rem 0 4rem;animation:rise .6s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.5,1)}
.lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;min-height:560px}
.lphoto{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#2a3175,#1c2150 60%,#d93f5c 150%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
.lphoto svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.lcap{position:relative;margin:0;padding:1.5rem;color:#eceaf4;font:400 1.7rem/1.15 "Young Serif",Georgia,serif}
.dr{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:50% 0;animation:hang 3.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes hang{from{transform:rotate(-4deg)}to{transform:rotate(4deg)}}
.lform{padding:3rem 2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.lform h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)}
.pw{position:relative}
.pw input{padding-right:5rem}
.pw button{position:absolute;right:.5rem;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:.4rem .6rem}
.lrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 1.25rem;font-size:.95rem}
.lrow label{display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:center}
.lrow input{accent-color:var(--accent)}
#l-status{min-height:1.6rem;margin:1rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
.swap{margin:1.25rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
.link{border:0;background:none;color:var(--accent);font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0;text-decoration:underline}
.lform .btn{width:100%;text-align:center}
@media (max-width:860px){.lgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lphoto{min-height:280px}.lform{padding:2rem 1.5rem}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.dr,.lpage{animation:none}}
.acct{display:grid;place-items:center;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1),background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
.acct:hover,.acct:focus-visible,.acct.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.acct:hover{transform:rotate(-12deg) scale(1.12)}
@media (max-width:700px){header .wrap{justify-content:flex-start;gap:.6rem}.acct{margin-left:auto}.menu{order:2}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.acct{transition:none}}
.acct{position:relative}
.acct.in::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:1px;right:1px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#2fa36b;border:2px solid var(--surface)}
#l-out[hidden]{display:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header><div class="wrap">
  <a class="logo" href="#top"><span class="om" aria-hidden="true">ॐ</span>Om Boutique</a>
  <nav id="mainnav" aria-label="Main"><a href="#top">Home</a><a href="#new">New in</a><a href="#collections">Collections</a><a href="#story">Our story</a><a href="#visit">Visit</a><a href="#measure">Send measurements</a></nav>
  <button class="menu" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainnav"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  <a class="acct" href="#login" aria-label="Login" title="Login"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4.4 3.6-7 8-7s8 2.6 8 7"/></svg></a>
</div></header>

<main id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Clothes worth keeping.</h1>
      <p>Small-batch dresses, kurtas and everyday layers, made in natural fabrics by makers we know by name. Pieces that get better every time you wear them.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#new">See what’s coming</a><a class="btn alt" href="#visit">Visit the store</a>
    </div>
    <span class="mandala" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="fl" style="left:4%;top:12%;width:46px;height:46px;background:#d93f5c"></span>
    <span class="fl" style="left:46%;top:6%;width:30px;height:30px;background:#4a7c6f;animation-delay:-2s"></span>
    <span class="fl" style="left:38%;bottom:8%;width:60px;height:60px;background:#f2b8c4;animation-delay:-4s"></span>
    <span class="fl" style="right:6%;bottom:12%;width:36px;height:36px;background:#e8c25b;animation-delay:-1s"></span>
    <div class="tagwrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="tag"><b>Block-print wrap dress</b><span>Cotton mulmul · Jaipur</span><em>₹3,450</em></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track"><span>Om Boutique ✦ New arrivals ✦ Hand block-printed ✦ Free alterations ✦ Om Boutique ✦ New arrivals ✦ Hand block-printed ✦ Free alterations ✦</span><span>Om Boutique ✦ New arrivals ✦ Hand block-printed ✦ Free alterations ✦ Om Boutique ✦ New arrivals ✦ Hand block-printed ✦ Free alterations ✦</span></div></div>

  <section id="new"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><h2>New in</h2><a href="#collections">Browse all collections</a></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><div class="sw s1"><b class="soon">Coming soon</b></div><h3>Dresses</h3><p>Arriving soon</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="sw s2"><b class="soon">Coming soon</b></div><h3>Kurtas</h3><p>Arriving soon</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="sw s3"><b class="soon">Coming soon</b></div><h3>Co-ord sets</h3><p>Arriving soon</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="sw s4"><b class="soon">Coming soon</b></div><h3>Jackets</h3><p>Arriving soon</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="collections"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><h2>Shop by collection</h2></div>
    <div class="cols">
      <div class="col"><h3>Everyday</h3><span class="pill">Coming soon</span><p>Soft cotton and linen you can live in from morning chai to late dinners.</p></div>
      <div class="col"><h3>Festive</h3><span class="pill">Coming soon</span><p>Hand-embroidered and block-printed pieces for weddings, Diwali and Eid.</p></div>
      <div class="col"><h3>Gifting</h3><span class="pill">Coming soon</span><p>Dupattas, tote bags and scarves, wrapped in reusable cloth at no charge.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="story"><div class="wrap story">
    <h2>Made slowly, sold honestly.</h2>
    <div>
      <p>Om Boutique started as one rack of hand-dyed kurtas. Today we work with weavers and printers across Rajasthan, and we pay them before the season starts, not after.</p>
      <p>Every piece has its fabric, maker and care instructions written on the tag, so you know what you are buying and how to make it last.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="visit"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="visit">
      <div><h2>Come try things on.</h2><p>Our stylists will help you find the right fit. Alterations take two days and are free on all purchases.</p></div>
      <dl>
        <dt>Address</dt><dd>12 Gumanpura Road, Kota</dd>
        <dt>Mon–Sat</dt><dd>11 am to 8 pm</dd>
        <dt>Sunday</dt><dd>12 pm to 6 pm</dd>
        <dt>Phone</dt><dd>+91 98765 43210</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</main>

<div id="measure" class="mpage" hidden>
<div class="wrap">
  <h2>Send us your measurements</h2>
  <p class="lead">Fill in what you know and press send and your details reach us straight away. Skip any box you are unsure about.</p>
  <div class="mgrid">
    <form id="mform" novalidate>
      <div class="pair">
        <div class="field"><label for="m-name">Your name</label><input id="m-name" autocomplete="name"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="m-phone">Phone or email (so we can reply)</label><input id="m-phone" autocomplete="tel"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="m-item">What is it for?</label><select id="m-item"><option>Blouse</option><option>Kurta</option><option>Dress</option><option>Lehenga</option><option>Trousers</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="m-unit">Measuring in</label><select id="m-unit"><option value="inches">Inches</option><option value="cm">Centimetres</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="measures">
